     <p style="line-height:24px;background:white"><span style="font-size:16px;font-family:宋体;color:#333333">一、考场编排</span></p><p style="line-height:24px;background:white"><span style="font-size:16px;font-family:宋体;color:#333333"> </span></p><p style="line-height: 16px;"><img style="vertical-align: middle; margin-right: 2px;" src="http://10.176.17.2/UEditor/dialogs/attachment/fileTypeImages/icon_xls.gif" /><a style="font-size:12px; color:#0066cc;" href="/Shaoxingyizhong/UploadFiles/xwzx/2024/9/202409291058270735.xls" title="202409291058270735.xls">202409291058270735.xls</a></p><p style="line-height:24px;background:white"><span style="font-size:16px;font-family:宋体;color:#333333"></span>
</p><p style="line-height:24px;background:white"><span style="font-size:16px;font-family:宋体;color:#333333"> </span></p><p style="line-height:24px;background:white"><span style="font-size:16px;font-family:宋体;color:#333333">二、监考安排</span></p><p style="line-height:28px;background:white"><span style=";font-family: 宋体;color:#333333">1.</span><span style=";font-family:宋体;color:#333333">考务组设在<span style="background: yellow;background:yellow">4112</span></span><span style=";font-family:宋体;color:red;background:yellow;background:yellow">（高一楼旁阶梯教室）</span><span style=";font-family:宋体;color:#333333;background:yellow;background:yellow">。</span></p><p style="line-height:28px;background:white"><span style=";font-family: 宋体;color:#333333">2.</span><span style=";font-family:宋体;color:#333333">本场考试</span><span style=";font-family:宋体;color:red">不需要</span><span style=";font-family:宋体;color:#333333">粘贴条形码</span><span style=";font-family:宋体;color:black">，</span><span style=";font-family:宋体;color:#333333">请监考老师</span><span style=";font-family:宋体;color:red">提前25分钟领卷</span><span style=";font-family:宋体;color:#333333">，领卷后直入试场。</span></p><p style="line-height:28px;background:white"><span style=";font-family: 宋体;color:#333333">3.</span><strong><span style=";font-family:宋体;color:#333333">提前5分钟发答题纸和试卷（有广播）</span></strong><span style=";font-family:宋体;color:#333333">，铃响后再让学生答题。</span><span style=";font-family:宋体;color:#C00000">如果遇到学生答题区域错误，请将学生的考生号，姓名，座位号，题号登记在答题纸袋上。</span></p><p style="line-height:28px;background:white"><span style=";font-family: 宋体;color:#333333">4.</span><span style=";font-family:宋体;color:#333333">离考试结束15分钟提醒学生填涂答题纸。</span><span style=";font-family:宋体;color:red">结束铃响后及时制止学生拖答</span><span style=";font-family:宋体;color:#333333">。</span></p><p style="line-height:28px;background:white"><span style=";font-family: 宋体;color:#333333">5.</span><span style=";font-family:宋体;color:#333333">考试结束后，请监考老师将所有考生的答题纸收回并清点，并将缺考考生的答题纸一并回收交考务组（</span><span style=";font-family:宋体;color:red">放在最后</span><span style=";font-family:宋体;color:#333333">）。</span></p><p style="line-height:28px;background:white"><span style=";font-family: 宋体;color:#333333">6.</span><span style=";font-family:宋体;color:#333333">本次考试改卷请于10月9日17：00前完成，使用智学网阅卷。</span></p><p style="line-height:28px;background:white"><span style=";font-family: 宋体;color:#333333">7.</span><span style=";font-family:宋体;color:#333333">考务组成员：杨佩琼、钟慧军、马丹娜、鲍策奔、何誉文</span></p><p style="line-height:28px;background:white"><span style=";font-family: 宋体;color:#333333">8.</span><span style=";font-family:宋体;color:#333333">巡考员：杨佩琼、钟慧军、马丹娜</span></p><table><tbody><tr style=";height:18px" class="firstRow"><td colspan="6" style="border: 1px solid black; background: rgb(250, 242, 242); padding: 0px 7px;"><p style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:13px;font-family:'Arial',sans-serif;color:black">10</span><span style="font-size:13px;font-family:宋体;color:black">月</span><span style="font-size:13px;font-family:'Arial',sans-serif;color:black">06</span><span style="font-size:13px;font-family:宋体;color:black">日（周日）</span></p></td></tr><tr style=";height:18px"><td colspan="3" style="border-right: 1px solid black; border-bottom: 1px solid black; border-left: 1px solid black; border-image: initial; border-top: none; background: rgb(250, 242, 242); padding: 0px 7px;"><p style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:13px;font-family:宋体;color:black">语文</span></p></td><td colspan="3" style="border-top: none; border-left: none; border-bottom: 1px solid black; border-right: 1px solid black; background: rgb(250, 242, 242); padding: 0px 7px;"><p style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:13px;font-family:宋体;color:black">技术</span></p></td></tr><tr style=";height:18px"><td colspan="3" style="border-right: 1px solid black; border-bottom: 1px solid black; border-left: 1px solid black; border-image: initial; border-top: none; background: rgb(250, 242, 242); padding: 0px 7px;"><p style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:13px;font-family:'